OL,3,GNEWSAHow Clarkson's Farm is attracting
OL,4,Ayoung people to farming
OL,5,
OL,6,FEllie grew up in a farming family and
OL,7,Fhad planned to pursue a different
OL,8,Fcareer, until she was drawn back to
OL,9,Fagriculture by what her college has
OL,10,Fcalled "the Clarkson effect".
OL,12,FThe 17-year-old is one of a growing
OL,13,Fnumber of young people choosing a
OL,14,Fcareer in farming, with Myerscough
OL,15,FCollege in Lancashire putting a rise of
OL,16,F30% in applications down to the impact
OL,17,Fof Jeremy Clarkson's reality show on
OL,18,FAmazon Prime Video.
OL,20,FFirst broadcast in 2021, it has
OL,21,Ffollowed the broadcaster attempts to
OL,22,Frun a farm in the Cotswolds.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
