OL,3,GNEWSAHow Clarkson's Farm is attracting
OL,4,Ayoung people to farming
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor Ellie, Clarkson has put agriculture
OL,7,F"in front of everyone in the country"
OL,8,Fand inspired her to follow the same
OL,9,Fpath as her parents and grandparents.
